---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - LiveMusicLocal" showNav={true} description="Read how the LiveMusicLocal website handles form submissions and uses third-party services.">
	<main class="flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-start p-8 relative overflow-hidden bg-[#121212]">
		<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

		<div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-8">
			<h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">
				Privacy Policy
			</h1>

			<div class="glass-panel p-8 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 backdrop-blur-xl bg-surface-container/40">
                <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none font-body text-on-surface-variant">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-on-surface font-semibold mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
                    <p class="mb-6">
                        We collect information you provide directly to us, such as when you sign up for our notification list or contact us.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-on-surface font-semibold mb-4">2. How We Use Information</h2>
                    <p class="mb-6">
                        We use the information we collect to communicate with you, provide our services, and improve our platform.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="text-2xl text-on-surface font-semibold mb-4">3. Information Sharing</h2>
                    <p class="mb-6">
                        Our website forms submit directly to Formspree, a third-party form service. Formspree processes the email address you enter for beta updates, and the contact or sponsorship details you submit, so we can receive and respond to your request. See <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy/" class="underline hover:text-primary">Formspree’s privacy policy</a> for information about its processing.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mb-6">
                        This website loads fonts from Google Fonts. Your browser makes requests to Google to retrieve these fonts, which can expose connection information such as your IP address. See <a href="https://developers.google.com/fonts/faq/privacy" class="underline hover:text-primary">Google Fonts privacy information</a>.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mb-6">
                        If you have questions about information you have submitted, want to stop receiving updates, or wish to request deletion, please <a href="/contact" class="underline hover:text-primary">contact us</a>. This notice describes this marketing website; it is not an audit of the separate beta app’s data handling.
                    </p>

                    <p class="text-sm text-outline mt-12">
                        Last updated: November 8, 2026
                    </p>
                </div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.glass-panel {
		background: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.4);
		backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
	}
</style>
